eviction/complete-output requirements.\n\nSimplification: Keep plain nouns/verbs for agents and people, with precise native provenance beside them. One global collision algorithm and one explicit surface-versus-native boundary avoid ad hoc app exceptions. Retain all four user claims, adopted775 outcomes and later OAuth, Tasks/Apps/resources/prompts/application-server/cold-host work. W1–W7 remain prospective; design prose is not implementation conformance.\n\nCoverage: Primary new mapping/body changes read first; both peer finals/audits FULL Root read. Native BODY86424B1007LF SHA55724a79a8f31e846884c4b51a947e68c46ddb431e8329446053b841787639f3 has complete coverage:69199 bytes inherited from the previously FULL350c body after exact native comparison, plus39 fresh changed units17225B FULL. Root independently verified both reconstruction ledgers cover0:86424 without gaps and FULL U354730B384LF SHA421615c51e90a999ee1d31d98772a572a2fe13c0d2f72314541ec154903ed3cc. Index U31452B SHAec4b8fadb6d91a364cbc941599653fed044fb84cc82de83b1ba4105ea089b72f FULL Root read; unchanged index not claimed FULL. Plan030 glossary225–270 exact2241B FULL; initial normalized excerpt missing its final LF had zero exact-native credit, corrected and reread. Bounded native register/FieldType/CLI units corroborate findings; no whole-file runtime proof. Other over-bound/truncated previews had zero authority and were recovered as recorded.\n\nNo verdict was filed on retired Draft5: the normal prepare refused its retired artifact. Normal Draft6 binding is design2c3832 / promise059afc and both exact artifacts only. Checker executed no Source/tests/build/gate/browser/provider/private work. Changes requested grant no merge, implementation, cloud deployment or protocol amendment. Repair within the same design request/promise when scope and performer remain unchanged; publish the repaired exact head.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:203dcbce8c888894c790e457e2421